m","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பண்","tr":"paṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டொரு","tr":"ṭoru"}]},{"text":"காலே","tr":"kālē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லே","tr":"lē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"மலை","parts":[{"text":"மலை","lemma":"மலை","gloss":"mountain"}],"gloss":"mountain"},{"surface":"இடை","parts":[{"text":"இடை","lemma":"இடை","gloss":"middle"}],"gloss":"intervening space"},{"surface":"இட்ட","parts":[{"text":"இட்ட","lemma":"இடு","gloss":"placed"}],"gloss":"placed"},{"surface":"நாட்டரும்","parts":[{"text":"நாட்டரும்","lemma":"நாட்டரும்","gloss":"man of the country also"}],"gloss":"man of the country also","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அல்லர்","parts":[{"text":"அல்","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"not"},{"text":"அர்","lemma":"அர்","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"he is not"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மரம்","parts":[{"text":"மரம்","lemma":"மரம்","gloss":"tree"}],"gloss":"tree"},{"surface":"தலை","parts":[{"text":"தலை","lemma":"தலை","gloss":"top"}],"gloss":"top"},{"surface":"தோன்றா","parts":[{"text":"தோன்று","lemma":"தோன்று","gloss":"appear"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ஆ","gloss":"not"}],"gloss":"not appearing"},{"surface":"ஊரரும்","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"town"},{"text":"அர்","lemma":"அர்","gloss":"he"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"man of the town also"},{"surface":"அல்லர்","parts":[{"text":"அல்","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"not"},{"text":"அர்","lemma":"அர்","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"he is not"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கண்ணின்","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eye"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the eyes"},{"surface":"காண","parts":[{"text":"காண்","lemma":"காண்","gloss":"see"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to see"},{"surface":"நண்ணு","parts":[{"text":"நண்ணு","lemma":"நண்ணு","gloss":"be near"}],"gloss":"near"},{"surface":"வழி","parts":[{"text":"வழி","lemma":"வழி","gloss":"place"}],"gloss":"place"},{"surface":"இருந்தும்","parts":[{"text":"இருந்தும்","lemma":"இருந்தும்","gloss":"even though being"}],"gloss":"even though being","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கடவுள்","parts":[{"text":"கடவுள்","lemma":"கடவுள்","gloss":"deity"}],"gloss":"deity"},{"surface":"நண்ணிய","parts":[{"text":"நண்ணு","lemma":"நண்ணு","gloss":"approach"},{"text":"இய","lemma":"இய","gloss":"who"}],"gloss":"who approached"},{"surface":"பாலோர்","parts":[{"text":"பால்","lemma":"பால்","gloss":"part"},{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ஓர்","gloss":"those who have"}],"gloss":"devotees"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல்","lemma":"போல்","gloss":"resemble"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒரீஇ","parts":[{"text":"ஒரீஇ","lemma":"ஒருவு","gloss":"avoiding"}],"gloss":"avoiding"},{"surface":"ஒழுகும்","parts":[{"text":"ஒழுகு","lemma":"ஒழுகு","gloss":"behave"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"who"}],"gloss":"who behaves"},{"surface":"என்னைக்கு","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ஐ","gloss":"lord"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to my lord"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பரியலென்","parts":[{"text":"பரி","lemma":"பரி","gloss":"grieve"},{"text":"அல்","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"not"},{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"I"}],"gloss":"I do not grieve"},{"surface":"மன்","parts":[{"text":"மன்","lemma":"மன்","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"யான்","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"யான்","gloss":"I"}],"gloss":"I"},{"surface":"பண்டு","parts":[{"text":"பண்டு","lemma":"பண்டு","gloss":"once"}],"gloss":"once"},{"surface":"ஒரு","parts":[{"text":"ஒரு","lemma":"ஒரு","gloss":"one"}],"gloss":"one"},{"surface":"காலே","parts":[{"text":"காலே","lemma":"காலே","gloss":"time indeed"}],"gloss":"time indeed","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"Mountain intervening placed country-man-also he-is-not / Tree tops not-appearing town-man-also he-is-not / With-eyes to-see near place even-though-being / Deity approached devotees like / Avoiding who-behaves to-my-lord / I-do-not-grieve indeed I once one time-indeed","translation":"He is not a man from a country separated by intervening mountains. He is not a man from a town so distant that its treetops cannot be seen. Even though he is in a place close enough to be seen with the eyes, he avoids me and behaves like devotees who keep a respectful distance from a deity. For my lord who conducts himself thus, I did not grieve once upon a time, but now I do.","modern":"அவர் மலைகளால் பிரிக்கப்பட்ட நாட்டைச் சேர்ந்தவரும் அல்லர். மரங்களின் உச்சிகள் கூடத் தெரியாத தூரத்து ஊரைச் சேர்ந்தவரும் அல்லர். கண்ணால் பார்க்கக்கூடிய மிக அருகில் இருந்தும், தெய்வத்தை நெருங்கும் பூசாரிகளைப் போல என்னை விலகி நடக்கும் என் தலைவனுக்காக, நான் முன்பு ஒரு காலத்தில் வருந்தாமல் இருந்தேன்.","explanation":"In this Marutam poem, the heroine expresses her deep sorrow to her confidante regarding the hero's emotional distance. She points out that he does not live in a far-off land separated by mountains, nor in a distant town whose treetops are invisible. Although he is close enough to be seen, he deliberately avoids her, behaving like a cautious devotee who maintains a respectful distance from a powerful deity. This striking comparison highlights how the hero treats his own wife with ritualistic avoidance rather than intimate affection. The heroine laments that while she did not grieve over his behavior in the past, his continued indifference now causes her immense pain. The setting of the same town emphasizes the irony of physical proximity paired with emotional alienation, which is central to the Marutam landscape of infidelity and sulking.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}